```
Title: AWS Bedrock Guardrail Deleted
Author: Marco Pedrinazzi (@pedrinazziM) (InTheCyber)
Date: 2026-07-10
Level: medium
Description: Detects deletion of an Amazon Bedrock guardrail, which may indicate attempts to remove
# model safety controls and allow unsafe or unauthorized model responses.
MITRE Tactic: Uncategorized
Tags: attack.defense-impairment, attack.t1685
Reference: https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/cloud/aws/cloudtrail/aws_cloudtrail_bedrock_guardrail_deleted.yml
# False Positives:
#   - Legitimate guardrail deletion by authorized identities.
```
eventName="DeleteGuardrail" eventSource="bedrock.amazonaws.com"